        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "农田灌溉用水 farmland irrigation water",
        "bbox": [
            124,
            771,
            426,
            787
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "为满足农作物生长需要，经人为输送，直接或通过渠道、管道供给农田的水。",
        "bbox": [
            124,
            789,
            721,
            806
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.2",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            90,
            809,
            119,
            822
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "水田作物 paddy field crops",
        "bbox": [
            124,
            827,
            334,
            843
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "适于水田淹水环境生长的农作物，如水稻等。",
        "bbox": [
            124,
            845,
            475,
            860
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "header",
        "text": "GB 5084—2021",
        "bbox": [
            92,
            83,
            221,
            97
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "2",
        "bbox": [
            92,
            920,
            104,
            931
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "旱地作物 dry land crops",
        "bbox": [
            149,
            137,
            337,
            152
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "适于旱地、水浇地等非淹水环境生长的农作物，如小麦、玉米、棉花等。",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            155,
            710,
            172
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4 农田灌溉水质要求",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            112,
            192,
            289,
            208
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4.1 农田灌溉水质控制项目分为基本控制项目和选择控制项目。",
        "bbox": [
            112,
            229,
            610,
            244
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4.1.1 基本控制项目为必测项目，应符合表 1的规定。",
        "bbox": [
            112,
            248,
            534,
            263
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4.1.2 选择控制项目由地方生态环境主管部门会同农业农村、水利等主管部门根据农田灌溉用水类型和作物种类要求选择执行，应符合表 2的规定。",
        "bbox": [
            112,
            266,
            907,
            302
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "images/6f2c9c6d7337ef330fedb47d103324d84d31ea4c040d9fd3992319a7f66d7762.jpg",
        "table_caption": [
            "表1 农田灌溉水质基本控制项目限值"
        ],
        "table_footnote": [],
        "table_body": "<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">序号</td><td rowspan=\"2\">项目类别</td><td colspan=\"3\">作物种类</td></tr><tr><td>水田作物</td><td>旱地作物</td><td>蔬菜</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>pH值</td><td colspan=\"3\">5.5~8.5</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>水温/°C ≤</td><td colspan=\"3\">35</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>悬浮物/(mg/L) ≤</td><td>80</td><td>100</td><td> $60^a, 15^b$ </td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>五日生化需氧量( $BOD_5$ )/(mg/L) ≤</td><td>60</td><td>100</td><td> $40^a, 15^b$ </td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>化学需氧量( $COD_{Cr}$ )/(mg/L) ≤</td><td>150</td><td>200</td><td> $100^a, 60^b$ </td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>阴离子表面活性剂/(mg/L) ≤</td><td>5</td><td>8</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>氯化物(以 $Cl^-$ 计)/(mg/L) ≤</td><td colspan=\"3\">350</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>硫化物(以 $S^{2-}$ 计)/(mg/L) ≤</td><td colspan=\"3\">1</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>全盐量/(mg/L) ≤</td><td colspan=\"3\">1000(非盐碱土地区),2000(盐碱土地区)</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>总铅/(mg/L) ≤</td><td colspan=\"3\">0.2</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>总镉/(mg/L) ≤</td><td colspan=\"3\">0.01</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>铬(六价)/(mg/L) ≤</td><td colspan=\"3\">0.1</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>总汞/(mg/L) ≤</td><td colspan=\"3\">0.001</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>总砷/(mg/L) ≤</td><td>0.05</td><td>0.1</td><td>0.05</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>粪大肠菌群数/(MPN/L) ≤</td><td>40000</td><td>40000</td><td> $20000^a, 10000^b$ </td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>蛔虫卵数/(个/10L) ≤</td><td colspan=\"2\">20</td><td> $20^a, 10^b$ </td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"5\"> $^a$ 加工、烹调及去皮蔬菜。 $^b$ 生食类蔬菜、瓜类和草本水果。</td></tr></table>",
        "bbox": [
            117,
            349,
            902,
            826
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
